<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT 1996 net up sharply at 6.44 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>PLDT 1996 net up sharply at 6.44 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>		 (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating revenues	  28,616  vs  25,252</p>
<p>    Operating expenses	  17,247  vs  16,836</p>
<p>    Net profit		     6,440  vs   5,751</p>
<p>    EPS fully diluted (pesos)  93.83  vs   84.21</p>
<p>Note: Full name Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co .</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-9414</p>
</text>
